The Google Pay and Shopify-hosted payment handler specifications are not redistributed; tools/fetch_specs.py
downloads them from their publishers, pinned by sha256 in protocols.lock.toml.

The worlds a replay runs in are not in this repository; they ship with the CartTrace-100k dataset (worlds/). Their
products come from open catalogs, each under its own licence, named on every product and in the dataset's
LICENSES/ folder:
- Amazon Berkeley Objects (ABO), CC BY 4.0, by Amazon.com.
- Wayfair ANnotation DataSet (WANDS), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2021 Wayfair.
- Lazada product listings as released with ShoppingBench (Apache License 2.0).
Prices of ABO and WANDS products and all stock levels are synthetic.
